  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.BossBarPacket` and",
    "every nested action record.",
    "",
    "The title is [`Component`](crate::text::Component), adventure's component",
    "tree \u2014 the same type Java's records hold \u2014 and the colour / overlay are",
    "adventure `BossBar.Color` / `BossBar.Overlay` enums, reproduced in",
    "declaration order (they are sent as `NetworkBuffer.Enum`, i.e. a var int",
    "ordinal). The title travels with [`Component::write`] /",
    "[`Component::read`] (see [`crate::adventure::component_network`]).",
    "",
    "Java's `Action` is a sealed interface whose runtime type selects the wire",
    "layout after the action id; the port models it as an enum with the same six",
    "variants and ids."
  ],
